/// Calculated duplicate of fact_Sales for market basket analysis. Same grain and columns as fact_Sales. The M:M relationship with fact_Sales on Invoice No (BothDirections) is intentional — it enables co-purchase correlation: filtering one product in fact_Sales propagates across the M:M join to surface other products bought on the same invoice in fact_Market_Baskets.
